    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n18191" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">fimbrĭātus</span></b> ,
			a, um, adj.
		fimbriae, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>fibrous</i>, <i>fringed</i>
			(post-Aug.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">folia,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					21, 15, 55, § 92</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">capillus (milii),</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					18, 7, 10, § 53</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">usus est lato clavo ad manus fimbriato,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Suet. Caes. 45</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">flagrum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">App. M. 8, p. 214</span></i>
			.</div>
